\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kgneeWvMQEkQ7kNvwFx3yEy&_nc_oc=AdmCos644xe4dHWUXDw9H3xJxnb-HdTQKg9WMkYKZtQUM6-rfRMZlM2xgOLu-nElyVI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afzd80lgDqpfdGoaj3gY43GT08oPtVw-ZAQQQ6OjQS6sXQ&oe=69B93974"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rGy9ao9c1aEQ7kNvwGj4I8-&_nc_oc=AdmpiOXrdjLgA1GdMsRGxWJ8krukfXzrQj-0DlwbMACxflTJq9qqHM22HIGUnx9Ugb0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzrithEblVnRtBBf18RUudrq1TaldPWMB10FhmT1LmniA&oe=69B93AD6"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Q17jnQQb3VYQ7kNvwG8_cir&_nc_oc=Adn9uFHucLf1_YGNqQGG4txXP4GqmwwJoTZqqK2y16Ldgz5lsaq66mJ19bejK1kGWqA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyQX_cvQhuheFUH-SHK32k9yYWUbRJQSjszmO4DmToMNg&oe=69B94FF7"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771